      "widgets_values": [
        "FLUX.1 [dev] - BAN VE TAY, KHONG DUOC DUNG DE BAN\n\n=== DOC CHO NAY TRUOC ===\nFLUX.1 [dev] mang giay phep FLUX Non-Commercial. Ban sach in ra tu no la\nVI PHAM, tru khi mua giay phep thuong mai cua Black Forest Labs.\nDo la ly do file nay CHI o dinh dang giao dien. Toi khong noi dev vao\nstudio/ - de tranh mot hom nao do lo chay ca cuon sach bang no.\n\nDung file nay de tra loi DUNG MOT CAU HOI:\n  \"Tran chat luong co cao hon that khong?\"\nBiet cau tra loi roi thi moi quyet dinh duoc co dang mua giay phep khong.\n\n=== THU NAY DANG THU HON ===\nFLUX.2 [klein] 4B ra sau, giay phep APACHE 2.0 - ban hang thoai mai, khong\nphai xin ai. Ban GGUF Q4 chi ~2.6 GB, chay 4 buoc.\nMoi hon schnell (thang 8/2024) ca mot the he.\nHuong dan: docs.comfy.org/tutorials/flux/flux-2-klein\nNo dung bo node khac (text encoder Mistral chu khong phai T5), nen toi khong\ndoan cau hinh - lam theo trang tren.\n\n=== KHAC SCHNELL O DAU ===\n1. Co node FluxGuidance (mau cam). Schnell KHONG co.\n   Day la thu quan trong nhat. 3.5 la mac dinh. 2.0-2.5 net thoang hon,\n   4.0-5.0 bam prompt chat hon nhung de bi cung.\n2. Steps 24 chu khong phai 4. Schnell duoc chung cat cho 4 buoc, dev thi\n   khong - chay 4 buoc se ra be bet.\n3. Cham hon schnell khoang 6 lan. Tinh truoc thoi gian.\n\n=== VAN KHONG CO O NEGATIVE ===\nKien truc Flux chay CFG=1 nen phan negative bi bo qua, dev cung vay.\nCac thu KHONG muon phai viet vao o positive: \"no gray, no shading\".\nDay la cho khac SDXL, dung mang thoi quen tu ban SDXL sang.\n\n=== CAN TAI ===\nflux1-dev-Q4_K_S.gguf  ->  ComfyUI/models/unet/\nhuggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-dev-gguf\nT5, clip_l, ae.safetensors thi da co san tu schnell roi, dung lai duoc."
      ],
